lines+=['','## One-minute delayed execution','','Entry uses next-minute closing ask if still inside the limit, otherwise waits for a later qualifying signal. This changes the sampled trades, so a positive delayed result cannot rescue a losing first model on its own. A full minute can exceed normal execution latency. No historical depth is asserted in either model.','','| Asset | Trades | Wins/losses | Net after fees +1c |','|---|---:|---:|---:|']
