lines+=['','DOGE adds about0.56 theoretical trades/day before portfolio competition. Ten wins do not establish the required high success probability: a single two-contract loss around90c would cost about$1.8 and exceed this sample’s+$1.30 stressed profit. HYPE has the same problem with an even smaller sample. BNB’s missing bars are amplified by the61-consecutive-close requirement. ZEC’s nearly complete source data demonstrates that data repair alone will not fix its losing result.','','## Deployment implications','','Adding tickers alone is insufficient: both the scanner and engine use a four-asset allowlist. Account position classification, reconciliation, dashboard assumptions and tests would need corresponding expansion. The8contract/$7.60cap must stay shared across all assets. These are isolated-asset results before interference with the existing four-asset portfolio; an integrated replay could reduce opportunities further. No production configuration, service, order, or transfer was changed. No paper collector was started.','','## Validation and limits','','All34 opening-proxy entries were replayed through a read-only copy of the deployed market_data.scan; side and cushion matched, with mocked GET responses. A synthetic sufficiently deep book only tests scanner plumbing, not historical fillability. Chronology, price cap and P&L arithmetic assertions passed. Actual market outcome is used only after selection. This sample has no independent holdout, few trades, no historical depth, and no full operational outage/fill/reconciliation model. Coinbase data downloaded afterward can differ from what the API exposed live. Zero observed losses/drawdown is not zero risk.','','Earlier price-only tests are not used to declare this cushion model unsuccessful. Earlier DOGE September1–14 work overlaps these dates, so those trades must not be added to these counts as independent evidence. No criteria were relaxed to generate the reported results.','','[Coinbase candle documentation](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/api-reference/exchange-api/rest-api/products/get-product-candles) documents incomplete history and intervals without ticks. Market metadata, spot request batches, signal/trade ledgers, scanner snapshot, PLAN and validation are retained for reproduction.']
